# Files EAS Build should NOT upload.
#
# The Expo app lives in a subfolder of this repo, so `eas build` archives the
# whole repository. The backend isn't part of the mobile build, so it's left
# out to keep the upload small.
#
# Note: when this file exists, EAS uses it instead of .gitignore, so the
# usual ignores are repeated here.

# Backend — deployed separately on Render
rustbucket-backend/

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
*.pem

# Editor / OS / tooling noise
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
